    "why": "closes the torso's neck opening left by repair.trim (and by the dropped tripo_part_12, whose neck filled it; harpy-h2-bake/1 closed only its lower back part with the ellipsoid plug_100 and left a see-through gap at the base of the head: 119-130 px at azimuth 180 / 4.8 m, measured by see_through.py). Closed domed cap on the loop's best-fit plane: skirt ring 12 % outside the loop and 4 mm under it (tucks under the collar), lip ring on the rim 3 mm up (a ray grazing the rim meets the cap before the rim's culled inner side), closed underside. Dark feather tone with a soft procedural scallop (Voronoi F1, baked into BC and N); prototypes 2026-09-29: ellipsoid plugs left 5-85 px see-through, the cap 0-1 px on the high-poly. Proposal"
